      "_comment": "Handwriting / typescript / dedication-page observables. SIGNATURE_TELL fires when the detective is inspecting written matter — a signature in the sign-in register, the leftward slope of a hand, the nib pressure on a deed, the margin notations of a typescript. The case's central pivot is authorship (Agnes wrote the novel Marsh published; Agnes also signed the 1921 deed as the third signatory). Tells: hand-match landing, marginal correction, pressure mark, dedication-page handwriting matching letters from 1921, nib match, register slope, typescript correction in the same hand. authenticity_holds is the cooperative null used in early-game.",
      "gated_by_convergence": {
        "signature_tell:hand_match": 0.5,
        "signature_tell:third_signatory_revealed": 0.6,
        "signature_tell:dedication_match": 0.4
      },
